        "name": "Info",
        "position": { "col": 12, "row": 5 },
        "params": {
          "text": "TAKE ON ME — a-ha (1985)\n\nSynth-pop riff recreation at 169 BPM.\n\n- Riff: Step seq (1/8th) → Square + chorus + ping-pong delay\n  Notes: F#4-F#4-D4-B3-rest-E4-E4-E4 | G#4-G#4-A4-B4-A4-A4-A4-E4\n- Bass: Step seq (1/8th) → Saw + sub → Ladder 24dB\n  Bm (B2) then E (E3) pumping pattern\n- Drums: Drum seq (1/16th) → 909 kit\n  Kick on 1&3, snare on 2&4, 8th HH, clap doubles snare\n- Pads: Chord seq (whole notes) → Supersaw → LP\n  Bm – E – A – F#m progression\n\nTweak: chorus depth, delay feedback, pad filter cutoff."
        }
      }
